.Dd August 22, 2026
.Dt MAC_LOMAC_GROK.CONF 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mac_lomac_grok.conf , POLICY , lomac-policy.contexts
.Nd configuration for
.Xr mac_lomac_grok 8
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Ss mac_lomac_grok.conf
Sourced via
.Xr rc.conf 5 .
Variables:
.Bl -tag -width mac_lomac_grok_checkpoint
.It Va mac_lomac_grok_enable
Default
.Dq NO .
.It Va mac_lomac_grok_dir
Default
.Pa /usr/local/etc/mac_lomac_grok .
.It Va mac_lomac_grok_db
Default
.Pa /var/db/mac_lomac_grok .
.It Va mac_lomac_grok_contexts
Installed spec path, default
.Pa /etc/lomac.contexts .
.It Va mac_lomac_grok_checkpoint
.Dq YES
to take a
.Xr zpool-checkpoint 8
during
.Cm snapshot .
.El
.Ss POLICY
.Pa KEY=value
lines consumed by
.Cm stage
and
.Cm update :
.Va TRUSTED_CLASS , SANDBOX_CLASS , TRUSTED_GROUP , SANDBOX_GROUP ,
.Va DEFAULT_ROLE , ROOT_LABEL , TRUSTED_LABEL , SANDBOX_LABEL .
Groups of users share a login class; see
.Xr mac_lomac_grok 7 .
.Ss Contexts
.Xr setfsmac 8
specfiles, first matching entry wins:
.Pa dev-modern.contexts
.Pq current Pa /dev
names: DRM card vs render, evdev, hid; old agp/kmem still listed ,
.Pa x11-xorg.contexts
.Pq Xorg 1 and cleartmp 8 sockets ,
optional
.Pa lomac-overlay.contexts ,
then the official PLM
.Pa lomac-policy.contexts .
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Pa
.It Pa /usr/local/etc/mac_lomac_grok.conf
.It Pa /usr/local/etc/mac_lomac_grok/POLICY
.It Pa /etc/lomac.contexts
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mac_lomac_grok 8 ,
.Xr mac_lomac_grok 4 ,
.Xr setfsmac 8 ,
.Xr login.conf 5 ,
.Xr rc.conf 5
